Title: The Last Spark - Cabin Scene
Author: A. Storyteller
Credit: A Visual Novel Example
Scene: The Old Cabin

EXT. OLD CABIN - DAY

An old cabin stands alone in the woods. The weathered structure looms imposingly, its wooden planks darkened by time and rain. Vines crawl up the sides. A heavy wooden door hangs slightly crooked on its hinges.

ELARA (19, with determined eyes and practical, worn-out clothing) approaches cautiously, her hand resting on the knife at her belt.

She reaches the door and tries the handle.

SFX: Door rattle

The handle won't budge. It's locked from the inside.

Elara looks around, then notices something glinting in the dirt near the doorstep. She kneels down and brushes away the soil, revealing an old iron key.

She inserts the key into the lock.

SFX: Key turn, door creak

The door creaks open slowly, revealing a dark interior beyond.

INT. OLD CABIN - MAIN ROOM - DAY

Elara steps cautiously through the doorway. Dusty sunbeams filter through cracks in the boarded windows. The air is thick with the smell of decay and forgotten memories.

Her eyes adjust to the dim light.

On a wooden table in the center of the room sits a single, faintly glowing seed - the LUMIN SEED. It pulses with a soft, warm light, the only source of color in the gray, dusty space.

ELARA
(whispering to herself)
The Lumin Seed... I found it.

She moves toward the table, but something in the corner catches her eye. An old chest with rusted iron bands sits partially hidden in shadow.

Elara approaches the chest and tries to open it. It's locked.

ELARA
(thinking aloud)
There has to be a key somewhere around here...

She searches the room, rifling through debris. After a moment, she finds a small brass key hidden under a loose floorboard.

She returns to the chest and inserts the key.

SFX: Lock clicks

The lock clicks open. Elara lifts the heavy lid.

SFX: Chest creaks open

The chest is completely empty - just dust and cobwebs inside.

ELARA
(shocked)
No... it can't be!

She stares at the empty chest, her face falling.

ELARA (CONT'D)
Someone got here first.

Suddenly, behind her—

SFX: Door slams shut

The cabin door SLAMS shut with a thunderous bang. Elara spins around.

She rushes to the door and tries the handle. It won't open.

ELARA
(panicking)
What?! No!

She pulls harder, but the door is sealed tight. She's trapped.

Elara takes a deep breath, trying to calm herself. She looks around the cabin with new eyes, searching for options.

Her gaze falls on:
- The heavy wooden door, now firmly shut
- A boarded-up window with a crack of light
- Strange arcane markings carved into the wall near the fireplace

What will she do?

FADE OUT.
